  "description": "Child of r_d357c10e: broad tape-grass blades 15-20 mm wide (was 10-15) and 0.24-0.55 m long (was 0.14-0.36), shoot spread 0.26 m, long blades bent further over (34-80 deg at the tip); 4 segments only above 0.36 m. Same single node 'seagrass', one primitive, one opaque double-sided material and texture; 300 triangles (was 304); bounds 0.70 x 0.44 x 0.82 m (was 0.53 x 0.31 x 0.59). About 2.5x the blade area per triangle.",
